A main package whose types reach encoding/json and reflect only through values of its own: a
type argument of reflect.TypeFor, a type parameter a generic function of the program decodes
into, an empty-interface parameter of its own function, an embedded unexported struct, and a
struct returned as an interface and encoded by the caller, directly or through a table of
handlers or through a bound method value, beside a struct returned the same way
and never encoded and one a function literal returns.

